# ISP Web Frontend Rules

Read `docs/PROJECT-MEMORY.md` and `docs/12-AI-CODING-RULES.md` before coding.

## Scope (Phase 1)
- Static mock data ONLY — no API calls to isppaybd.com
- All fonts/images local in `public/`
- Mirror all portals from `isppaybd_isp` sidebar

## Code boundaries
- Pages in `src/app/` — thin, compose from `src/features/`
- Data via `src/lib/mock-api/client` — NEVER import `@/mocks` in features
- shadcn/ui + Tailwind — no MUI/Chakra/Ant/DaisyUI
- Lucide icons only

## Required on every screen
- Loading skeleton + empty state
- Sonner toast on form submit
- Permission gates (`<Can menu action>`) on admin actions
- Responsive: 320px mobile + desktop
- Dark mode support

## Design tokens
- Primary `#f75803`, Secondary `#1a0b38`
- See `docs/04-DESIGN-SYSTEM.md`

## When done
- Mark screen in `docs/07-SCREEN-INVENTORY.md`
- Run `pnpm lint && pnpm build`

## Do not
- Modify `isppaybd_isp` during frontend-only work
- Commit unless user asks
- Skip phases in `docs/08-IMPLEMENTATION-PHASES.md`
